# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Business data — deliberately NOT committed
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# These workbooks and documents contain real customer information: ~220 named
# hospitals and clinics with account codes and delivery schedules. They are
# excluded so the repository holds code only. The test suite does not need them
# (it uses tests/domain/sites_clean.csv, which carries anonymised IDs).
#
# To share them, do so through an approved internal channel rather than adding
# them here — git history is effectively permanent.
